WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Of course

2
00:00:01,410 --> 00:00:03,330
This is a life-related matter

3
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:05,630
Maybe I can reveal something to you

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,760
To make you believe we got the rules, let's hear them

5
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,320
A rule about the toilet

6
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,120
In addition to needing to flush after going to the toilet

7
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,120
You also need to flush water before going to the toilet

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,320
Otherwise you will be responsible for the consequences

9
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,600
You said you didn't see the rules for people to go to the toilet?

10
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,880
Is it 100% illegal?

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,640
Your transaction requirements sound like

12
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,640
I want to trade with all old players

13
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,120
Did I make a mistake?

14
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,030
I don’t hide it from you either.

15
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:30,510
Then I think I should discuss it individually with other veteran players.

16
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,070
After all, you still need props

17
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:34,270
We always need to allocate it first

18
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:36,350
You will be our negotiating agent

19
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,390
But I only wait until 12:45

20
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,570
It says here

21
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,250
Different levels of benefits

22
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,050
The window for free consumption is different

23
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,550
But no one told me

24
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,550
What is the level of my benefits?

25
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,070
If you select the wrong window

26
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,900
Doesn’t it cost money to eat?

27
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:54,870
The key is, is there food we can eat here?
